										<td>Move</td>
										<td>Up to base Move Speed (30 ft). Sprinting or climbing = +1 STA per 10 ft.</td>
										<td>Track how they move, not just where. Sloppy or rushed movement can trigger detection or opportunity attacks.</td>
									</tr>
									<tr>
										<td>Action</td>
										<td>Attack, use Technique, set trap, interact with environment.</td>
										<td>1 STA minimum unless ability says otherwise. Some Techniques cost more — remind players to check weapon cards.</td>
									</tr>
									<tr>
										<td>Fast Action</td>
										<td>Minor, quick actions (potions, swaps, toggles).</td>
										<td>Limit 1 per turn (unless ability says otherwise). Disallow chaining "fast" actions into combos — they're interrupts, not bonus turns.</td>
